	(gr_text "1. Eight per-branch 30 A fuses isolate any single ESC or thruster fault.\n2. An input TVS diode (22 V class) clamps rail transients from switching \nor disconnects.\n3. Bulk plus per-branch capacitance stabilizes the rail and absorbs commutation \nsurges.\n4. Primary disconnect and main fuse (225-250 A) live on the battery cable, \nnot the PCB.\n5. A bleed resistor drains the capacitor bank at power-down; a power LED \nshows a live rail."
		(at 118.71 88.85 0)
		(layer "F.SilkS")
		(uuid "cf941fc1-1d99-4d77-9d16-55f4823daa80")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.4 0.4)
				(thickness 0.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "4S · 200A CONT · 300A PEAK  \n(2oz all layers)\n\n4S · 100A CONT · 150A PEAK  \n(1oz outer / 0.5oz inner)\n"
		(at 124.3 102.98 0)
		(layer "F.SilkS")
		(uuid "c41123dc-71bf-4e8b-940d-008b86d325d1")
		(effects
